stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Search
    Search --> Search: Match keyword, name, description or executable
    Search --> Arguments: Exact command keyword followed by text
    Arguments --> Error: Extra arguments disabled or quoting incomplete
    Error --> Arguments: Correct input
    Search --> Dispatch: Enter on selected command
    Arguments --> Dispatch: Parse argument words / append to configured argv
    Dispatch --> Search: Built-in autocomplete changes prompt
    Dispatch --> Submitted: Session handler or program accepts command
    Submitted --> [*]: Close launcher
    state Settings {
        List --> Draft: Add or edit
        Draft --> Draft: Validation error
        Draft --> List: Save command array to Burl settings
        Draft --> List: Cancel
        Draft --> List: Delete selected command
    }
    note right of Arguments
        Quoting groups argument words.
        No shell expansion or command substitution.
        Configured arguments precede typed arguments.
    end note
